abstract: >-
  A developing, pre-validation public working framework asking what human and
  social foundations should precede possible AI-driven changes in work and
  material production. Released for criticism, prior-art correction and
  collaborative development rather than as a validated policy framework.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - human development
  - capability
  - agency
  - future of work
  - social infrastructure
